get a few things in order.

3
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:09.600
First, pick up your bowel prep kit from the pharmacy if you haven't already.

4
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:15.470
Secondly, make sure you have a responsible adult lined up to drive you home.

5
00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:16.080
You won't be able to

6
00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:21.140
drive yourself after the procedure. Also, stock your fridge with clear liquids,

7
00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:22.080
water, broth,

8
00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:28.800
clear juices, and popsicles. Starting now, begin shifting to a low-fiber diet.

9
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:29.520
Cut back on raw

10
00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:35.180
vegetables, whole grains, nuts, and seeds. And lastly, take a moment to review

11
00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:35.840
your current

12
00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:40.260
medications. If you take blood thinners, iron supplements, or diabetes

13
00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:41.200
medications, we have

14
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:45.620
specific guidance for each of those in the next few videos. As always, if

15
00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:47.440
anything comes up,

16
00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:50.340
don't hesitate to reach out to your doctor's office. You're off to a great

17
00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:50.800
start.
